{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ psychological psychiatric psychosocial) (+ anxiety stress mood sleep emotions))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_386975294#5_843851629","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2646","rank":2,"snippet":"Might Suffer Eye Injuries 4. Your Digestion Might Be Disrupted 5. Your Emotions Might Be Out Of Whack \" , \"segment\": \"Oh, and don't make the mistake of thinking your favorite pair of RayBans will cut it. Suck it up and wear the special glasses, friends. 4. Your Digestion Might Be Disrupted Some people believe that the solar eclipse can wreak havoc on your digestion. This is why extremely spiritual people choose to avoid meals and practice fasting during a total solar eclipse. 5. Your <cover>Emotions Might Be Out Of Whack Many people believe that the rare occurrence of a solar eclipse has psychological </cover>effects on humans. There are reports of increased agitation, unusual dreams, sudden bursts of creativity, and even relationship difficulties during a solar eclipse. So, whether you find yourself painting the next Starry Night, or you simply want to hit up your nearest library for some dope eclipse shades, one thing is certain: This infrequent, literally astronomical opportunity will be a sight to see.\" , \"start_char\": 3138.000000 , \"title\": \"5 Effects Of The Solar Eclipse On The Human Body That ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_379109228#5_964162810","rank":1,"relevance":0}]}}
