{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ \"affect your mood\" \"affects your mood\" \"affect mood\" \"affects mood\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_359314103#6_911950383","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2653","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_359314103#6_911950383\" , \"end_char\": 4193.000000 , \"headings\": \"Mark Your Calendar For May's New Moon In Sensual Taurus Mark Your Calendar For May's New Moon In Sensual Taurus New Moons Can <cover>Affect Your Mood New Moons Can Make You Sleepy You'll Feel More Motivated To Reach Your Goals New Moons Are A Good Time For Self-Care & Positivity Get Ready For The Upcoming New Moons \" , \"segment\": \"The August 2021 new moon is on August 8. The September 2021 new moon is on September 6. The October 2021 new moon is on October 6. The November 2021 new moon is on November 4. The December 2021 new moon is also a solar eclipse, </cover>and it's on December 3 PT/December 4 ET. This article was originally published on Aug. 6, 2020\" , \"start_char\": 3870.000000 , \"title\": \"When Is The Next New Moon? Your 2021 Calendar\" , \"url\": \"https://www.bustle.com/"}}
