{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ eclipse \"mental health\" (+ anxiety stress mood psychological emotional))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_35552739#7_91073054","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2655","rank":3,"snippet":"drawing? A. interactionist perspective B. conflict perspective C. functionalist perspective D. macrosociology Which perspective has begun to study a new form of commuter behavior called slugging? What is an authors perspective? What is the synonym of perspective? In what perspective is the Alex Rider? What is Malcolm perspective in Macbeth? \" , \"segment\": \"perspective is all that matters. What is biopsychological psychologist? A psychologist who makes overall observations or research studies based on a person's biological make up (their genetics, etc), <cover>psychological (mental health), and the social environment of the individual. What is ecological perspective? nothing ecological perspective What is the three story act of the book Eclipse? </cover>Bella's perspective, Jacob's perspective, Bella's perspective. What are the kind of perspective drawing? 1)Linear perspective drawing 2)Aeria perspective drawing. A. interactionist perspective B. conflict perspective C. functionalist perspective D. macrosociology Which perspective has begun to study a new form of commuter behavior called slugging? interactionalist perspective What is an authors perspective?\" , \"start_char\": 2837.000000 , \"title\": \"What is neuroscientific biopsychological perspective? - Answers\" , \"url\": \"http://","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_379109228#4_964160475","rank":1,"relevance":0},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_379109228#5_964162810","rank":2,"relevance":0}]}}
