{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_33_139972076#5_324700441","relevance":0,"reason":"This is an Anime-Planet recommendations page for an anime titled Total Eclipse; 'psychological impact' refers to fictional anime themes, not solar eclipses or mental health.","learned":"Broadening to 'total eclipse' can introduce false matches to fictional titles."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ anxiety panic fear worried worry) (+ people viewers experience))","reason":"Search for factual or advice-oriented discussions of anxiety, panic, fear, or worry among people viewing or anticipating a solar eclipse, which may yield documents directly addressing mental-health effects."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ anxiety panic fear worried worry) (+ people viewers experience))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_08_750852180#5_1356467592","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2672","rank":1,"snippet":"segment\": \"“The Sandhills are really going to be blessed with this,” Barr said. Barr said viewing a total solar eclipse can be a life-changing experience. It changed his, for example, because he started chasing solar eclipses and has studied them since. A lot of the experience is in the cameraderie at the viewing parties, as well. “Everyone is your friend,” Barr said. “ Everyone wants to share that experience.” Even though eclipses can be predicted years in advance, and modern science has explained the phenomenon, Barr said the experience still touches primal instincts. On one <cover>solar eclipse he attended in 1994, in Bolivia, local tribes lit bonfires to give energy back to the sun. “People know the eclipse is coming, and they intellectually prepare for it,” Barr said. “ But there is this primal fear.”</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 4591.000000 , \"title\": \"In 2017, two Nebraska villages to be center of total solar eclipse | Lifestyles | omaha.com\" , \"url\": \"http://www.omaha.com/living/in-two-nebraska-villages-to-be-center-of-total-solar/article_4baea926-1a4f-11e4-beda-001a4bcf6878.html\" }"}}
