{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_386975294#0_843842626","relevance":2,"reason":"This Elite Daily article is a list of possible solar-eclipse effects on the body and explicitly includes feeling lethargic/tired and emotions being out of whack. It is relevant to mental-health-adjacent effects, but it is not dedicated specifically to mental health and relies on weak lifestyle/spiritual framing.","learned":"The Elite Daily article's main headings include lethargy/tiredness and emotions being affected as possible solar-eclipse effects."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ \"affect your emotions\" \"affect your mood\" \"emotions\" \"mood\" \"energy\") (+ anxiety stress emotional psychological))","reason":"Search for pages more directly centered on emotional, mood, energy, or anxiety/stress effects of a solar eclipse, which are more likely to be dedicated to the user's mental-health question."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ \"affect your emotions\" \"affect your mood\" \"emotions\" \"mood\" \"energy\") (+ anxiety stress emotional psychological))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_908728868#1_1899444578","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2690","rank":1,"snippet":"blackbird energy. A friend had sent me a photo to draw, of a blackbird, I saw it as a bit of a challenge and agreed to do it, however, as my week progressed, I’d forgotten all about it. It reminded me and made me realise that I ought to check out what blackbird was showing me. I’ve always loved the blackbirds in my garden, but being privy to sharing my space with their young is indeed a blessing. The Inner Journey Before I go into the symbolism/energies of blackbird, perhaps I should first explain that the past week has been bumpy. My journey has been very solitary this week, the only painting I’ve done has been of meditation visions and at times it’s been very <cover>emotional, leading up to the solar eclipse energy </cover>at the weekend. Only today do I feel like I’m coming out the other side of another transitional shift in my energy.\" , \"start_char\": 833.000000 , \"title\": \"Totem Symbolism - Blackbird - Welcome - bluebutterflyspirit.com\" , \"url\": \"http://www.bluebutterflyspirit.com/totem-symbolism-blackbird/\" }"}}
