{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"solar eclipse\" (+ \"mood and emotions\" \"affect mood\" \"affects mood\" \"emotional time\" \"unusual dreams\") (+ astrology psychological))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_541815956#13_978598664","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2704","rank":6,"snippet":"Full Moon Wishes Come True Aquarius Lunar eclipses make it more difficult for you to get along with others, Aquarius, a wide step away from your compassionate, humanitarian personality. You may find yourself in conflicts with those around you, and you’ll need to amplify your patience and understanding to avoid becoming emotionally overwhelmed or starting arguments. Pisces A Lunar eclipse urges you to take precautions, Pisces, avoiding unnecessary trips or risks. Pay close attention to your actions and make sure to think things through before following the course. Writing in your journal is favored for exploring your feelings in a safe and healthy manner during this <cover>emotional time. Solar Eclipses A Solar eclipse occurs when the Moon passes between the Sun and Earth, obscuring our vision of the Sun. We experience a total Solar eclipse roughly once every 18 months. Solar eclipses occur during the New Moon, while Lunar eclipses take place during a Full Moon.\" , \"start_char\": 7383.000000 , \"title\": \"The Ultimate Guide to Lunar & Solar Eclipses | Astrology </cover>Answers\" , \"url\": \"https://astrologyanswers.com/article/lunar-solar-eclipse-guide/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_386975294#5_843851629","rank":1,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_318853832#6_734635937","rank":2,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_318853832#5_734634698","rank":3,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_541815956#15_978603660","rank":4,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_12_541815956#14_978601115","rank":5,"relevance":2}]}}
